      "id": "claim_cbcd4250a6334b7b832df7243eb01f7b",
      "statement": "The centralized ApiClient (src/lib/api-client.ts) auto-injects Authorization: Bearer <token> and X-Cabinet-Id headers read from the Zustand auth store on every request, unless skipAuth/skipCabinetId is set; an immutable initiating authToken/cabinetIdOverride wins over the mutable store values, non-OK responses throw ApiError with Retry-After extraction for 429/503, and the constructor rejects plain-HTTP production API URLs (outside localhost).",
