      "statement": "getSafeAuthRedirect in src/proxy.ts sanitizes authenticated redirects away from /login and /register: a redirect param is honored only if it starts with a single '/' (rejecting protocol-relative '//'), resolves to the same origin, and does not target an auth page; anything else falls back to /dashboard.",
