    {
      "id": "claim_567b76dfc9cf417c928ef03dc917bad0",
      "statement": "The Zustand authStore (src/stores/authStore.ts) persists user, token, cabinetId, and a per-login sessionNonce to localStorage via persist; login()/refreshToken() mirror the token into the auth-token cookie (24h) for the server proxy, logout() clears state and the cookie and signals cross-tab logout via a storage event, and rehydration re-establishes isAuthenticated, re-normalizes the user, re-sets the cookie, and syncs state across tabs via storage-event listeners.",
      "evidence": [
