    {
      "id": "claim_96295e72dcd24015ac1834121b2bc928",
      "statement": "The (dashboard) layout is a client-component fallback auth gate: it waits for Zustand persist hydration, and when an unauthenticated tab (no localStorage token, or a cross-tab logout) is detected it first clears the auth-token cookie and then router.replace's to /login with a redirect param — clearing the cookie first prevents the dashboard↔login redirect loop the proxy alone would cause.",
